{
  "title": { "zh": "边的强弱和朝向", "en": "Edge strength and direction" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "纸放斜了，它的边在横向、竖向两张图里各只出现一半。把两张合成一张。",
        "en": "With the paper askew, its edge shows only half in each of the two change maps. Combine them into one."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "横、竖两个变化合成一支箭头，叫<wiki-ref to=\"gradient\"></wiki-ref>：长短是边有多陡，方向是变亮最快的方向，和边垂直。",
    "en": "The two changes together make one arrow, the <wiki-ref to=\"gradient\"></wiki-ref>: its length says how steep the edge is, its direction is where brightness grows fastest, across the edge."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "gradient",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "carry": "1-9",
      "brief": {
